          "Osmoregulation — the maintenance of the water and salt content of the body.",
          "Thermoregulation — the maintenance of body temperature within suitable limits.",
          "Excretion — the removal of nitrogenous and other metabolic wastes from the body.",
          "Transpiration — the loss of water vapour from the aerial parts of a plant.",
          "Guttation — the loss of liquid water from the leaf margins through hydathodes.",
          "Xerophytes — plants of dry habitats, adapted to conserve water.",
          "Hydrophytes — plants that grow in fresh water.",
          "Halophytes — plants that grow in salty or marshy water.",
          "Mesophytes — plants of moderate water conditions.",
          "Nephron — the basic functional unit of the kidney.",
          "Bowman's capsule — the cup-like beginning of the nephron.",
          "Ultrafiltration — the forcing of plasma out of the glomerulus into the Bowman's capsule.",
          "Reabsorption — the return of useful substances from the filtrate to the blood.",
          "ADH — the antidiuretic hormone that makes the collecting ducts absorb water.",
          "Deamination — the removal of the amino group from an amino acid in the liver.",
          "Dialysis — the mechanical cleaning of blood when the kidneys fail.",
